        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-4192_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-4192_47439_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-256_47123_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Schedule Page: 120 Line No.:52.1 Column: c</p><p>Cash management program with Energy Transfer LP. </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-373_47124_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Energy Transfer LP (DE) owns 100% of ET CC Holdings LLC (DE). ET CC Holdings LLC (DE) owns 100% of ETP Crude LLC (DE).</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-813_47220_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Schedule Page 114 Line No.: 1 Column: c</p><p>In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $21 million are included in Account(s) 600.<br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1252_47223_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Schedule Page 220 Line No.: 2 Column: c</p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Effective April 1, 2025, CPLP merged with the Company and ET Crude Oil Terminals, LLC. As part of the merger, the Company received $2,048,397 in noncarrier property.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3154_47213_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Schedule Page: 120 Line No.:52.1 Column: b</p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Cash management program with Energy Transfer LP. </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3829_47394_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Other Adjustments due to Centurion Pipeline and SPLP conveyance true-ups.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-4027_47328_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Other Adjustments reflect asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-4168_47334_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" class="e-rte-table-border e-rte-paste-table" style="width: 450pt"> <tr style="height: 15pt">  <td height="20" width="525" style="padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">Please see the table below for the range of  depreciation rates for each asset group.</span></td>  <td width="75" style="padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><br /></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15pt">  <td height="20" style="border: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none">  <div><span lang="en-US">102  Right of way</span></div></td>  <td style="border-top: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">2.01 - 2.7</span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15pt">  <td height="20" style="border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">103  Line pipe</span></td>  <td style="border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padd