a(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">5.26 - 14.29</span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15pt">  <td height="20" style="border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">185  Vehicles and other work equipment</span></td>  <td style="border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">10.1 - 20.37</span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15pt">  <td height="20" style="border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">186  Other property</span></td>  <td align="right" style="border-right: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 1px; padding-left: 1px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none"><span lang="en-US">6.7  </span></td> </tr></table><p><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-4192_47439_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)">Schedule Page 700 Line No.: 9 Column: b</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $11,451,093 are included in line 10, interstate operating revenue. These revenues represent a one-time event and are not representative of future revenues. </span></p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br /></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model. This model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>